  "description": "The Teammachine SLR 01 SEVEN is undeniably Teammachine, with the ultimate race-bred geometry, iconic silhouette, and Impec Lab obsession to make it lighter, sharper, faster through targeted stiffness and responsiveness.\nIts refined carbon layup using our 01 Pro Carbon grade is unapologetically stiff, giving exceptional power transfer on the uphills and sharp handling on the downs. It’s light where it counts, aero where it matters, and engineered in a package that opens up BMC SLR 01 level to more riders.\nTCC Race compliance adds smoothness without compromising on stiffness, giving it that unmistakable BMC confidence across every road surface.\nDespite being the entry point to SLR 01 level performance, this model is finished with the ultra-efficient Shimano 105 Di2 groupset, dependable BMC CR 40 tubeless-ready carbon wheels for all gradients, as well our ICS 2 stem with alloy handlebars for a snappy cockpit setup.",
